msgid "Turbo ACC Center"
msgstr "Turbo ACC 网络加速"

msgid "Turbo ACC Acceleration Settings"
msgstr "Turbo ACC 网络加速设置"

msgid "Opensource Flow Offloading driver (Fast Path or Hardware NAT). Settings are written into firewall4 (nftables) defaults."
msgstr "开源流量分载驱动（Fast Path / 硬件 NAT），设置会写入 firewall4 (nftables) 的默认段。"

msgid "Software flow offloading"
msgstr "软件流量分载"

msgid "Hardware flow offloading"
msgstr "硬件流量分载"

msgid "Kernel based flow offloading via nftables (flow_offloading). Not fully compatible with QoS/SQM."
msgstr "由内核通过 nftables (flow_offloading) 实现的流量分载。与 QoS/SQM 不完全兼容。"

msgid "Hardware offloading uses NIC/SoC offload engines (e.g. MTK PPE/HNAT, Rockchip GMAC). Requires Software flow offloading to be enabled (firewall4 constraint)."
msgstr "硬件流量分载利用网卡/SoC 的 offload 引擎（如 MTK PPE/HNAT、Rockchip GMAC）。需要先启用软件流量分载（firewall4 强制要求）。"

msgid "BBR CCA"
msgstr "BBR 拥塞控制算法"

msgid "Using BBR CCA can improve TCP network performance effectively"
msgstr "使用 BBR 拥塞控制算法可以有效提升 TCP 网络性能"

msgid "FullCone NAT"
msgstr "全锥形 NAT"

msgid "Using FullCone NAT can improve gaming performance effectively"
msgstr "使用全锥形 NAT 可以有效提升游戏体验"

msgid "IPv6 Full Cone NAT"
msgstr "IPv6 全锥形 NAT"

msgid "Enabling IPv6 Full Cone NAT adds an extra layer of NAT to IPv6. In IPv6, if you obtain an IPv6 prefix through IPv6 Prefix Delegation, each device can be assigned a public IPv6 address, eliminating the need for IPv6 Full Cone NAT."
msgstr "启用 IPv6 全锥形 NAT 会给 IPv6 增加一层 NAT。对于 IPv6 来说，如果通过 IPv6 前缀代理 (IPv6-PD) 获取到了 IPv6 前缀，每个设备都可以分配到公网 IPv6 地址，无需开启 IPv6 全锥形 NAT。"

msgid "Running Status"
msgstr "运行状态"

msgid "RUNNING"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "NOT RUNNING"
msgstr "未运行"

msgid "Collecting data..."
msgstr "正在收集数据..."

msgid "Flow Offloading"
msgstr "流量分载"

msgid "Flow Offloading Type"
msgstr "流量分载类型"

msgid "Hardware Flow Offloading"
msgstr "硬件流量分载"

msgid "Software Flow Offloading"
msgstr "软件流量分载"

msgid "Requires hardware support, implemented at least for Filogic 8x0"
msgstr "需要硬件支持，目前 Filogic 8x0 已实现"

